{
  "project": {
    "name": "Crewneck Sweatshirt",
    "slug": "sweatshirt-crewneck",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "engine": "fc",
    "description": {
      "en": "FC-100 rank #6. Boxy fleece crewneck: front/back on fold, long sleeve with the cap solved to the armholes, and neckband, cuffs, and hem band derived from measured openings times rib recovery ratios.\n\nOfficial visualizer and configurator: Fashion Cabinet",
      "es": "Rango #6 del FC-100. Sudadera holgada de felpa: delantero/trasero al doblez, manga larga con copa resuelta a las sisas, y cuello, puños y pretina derivados de aberturas medidas por proporciones de rib.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Fashion Cabinet",
      "fr": "Rang #6 du FC-100. Sweat-shirt ras-du-cou boxy en molleton : devant/dos au pli, manche longue avec la tête résolue aux emmanchures, et bord d'encolure, poignets et bande d'ourlet dérivés des ouvertures mesurées multipliées par les rapports de reprise de la côte.\n\nVisualiseur et configurateur officiel : Fashion Cabinet"
    },
    "difficulty": "beginner",
    "tags": [
      "sweatshirt",
      "crewneck",
      "fleece",
      "fc100",
      "hyperobject",
      "commons"
    ],
    "attribution": {
      "author": "Innovaciones MADFAM",
      "license": "LicenseRef-FC1-pending",
      "lineage": [
        {
          "source": "Original draft for Fashion Cabinet",
          "license": "original"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "modes": [
